cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EDOS in research, teaching studies, workshops, publications, or academic projects, please cite this software."
title: "EDOS — Educational Desktop Operating Simulator"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Gupta"
    given-names: "Yash Munnalal"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  EDOS is a browser-based educational desktop environment for beginner Python
  learning. It provides client-side Python execution through Pyodide,
  beginner-friendly editing and terminal tools, a Jupyter-style notebook,
  package support, educational lessons, data-analysis examples, and a live
  GitHub-hosted learning library.
keywords:
  - Python
  - education
  - Pyodide
  - WebAssembly
  - Jupyter
  - programming education
  - browser Python
  - educational technology
  - data science education
license: "LicenseRef-EDOS-Source-Visible-Collaboration-License"


